// MISTAKE: the lender's statement owes 949.37 USD less than the schedule, and no flow into the loan says why. The difference is a prepayment nobody wrote.
base USD
use std

entity bank : lender
account checking : bank
asset condo : property

opening 2026-01-01
  checking 900_000 USD

contract mortgage with bank
  loan 120_000 USD on 2026-01-15 at 6% over 3y for condo
  monthly on 1 from checking
  from 2026-02-01
  until 2026-02-28

2026-01-15 mortgage

2026-02-01 mortgage
2026-02-28 mortgage = 116_000 USD
